.SH NAME
QStyle \- Encapsulates common Look and Feel of a GUI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qstyle.h>\fR
.PP
Inherits QObject.
.PP
Inherited by QCommonStyle.
.PP
